msgid "Create and write"
msgstr "Maken en schrijven"

#: templates/dg_wiki/_tree.html:1
msgid "No pages yet."
msgstr "Nog geen pagina's."

#: templates/dg_wiki/_version_head.html:6
#: templates/dg_wiki/page_history.html:15
msgid "Now"
msgstr "Nu"

#: templates/dg_wiki/_version_head.html:9
msgid ""
"Bring this version back? The page says this again, as a new version; nothing "
"is lost."
msgstr ""
"Deze versie terugzetten? De pagina zegt dit weer, als nieuwe versie; er gaat "
"niets verloren."

#: templates/dg_wiki/_version_head.html:12
msgid "Bring back"
msgstr "Terugzetten"

#: templates/dg_wiki/_version_head.html:16
msgid "Before the page"
msgstr "Voor de pagina bestond"

#: templates/dg_wiki/_wiki.html:16
msgid "Pages"
msgstr "Pagina's"

#: templates/dg_wiki/_wiki.html:21
msgid "Search the wiki"
msgstr "Zoeken in de wiki"

#: templates/dg_wiki/_wiki.html:24
msgid "Moving the page failed. The page will reload."
msgstr ""
"Het verplaatsen van de pagina is mislukt. De pagina wordt opnieuw geladen."

#: templates/dg_wiki/_wiki.html:29 templates/dg_wiki/home.html:19
#: templates/dg_wiki/page_create.html:4 templates/dg_wiki/page_create.html:8
msgid "New page"
msgstr "Nieuwe pagina"

#: templates/dg_wiki/home.html:4
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Start"

#: templates/dg_wiki/home.html:9
msgid "Recently changed"
msgstr "Onlangs gewijzigd"

#: templates/dg_wiki/home.html:15
msgid "Download the whole wiki as Markdown"
msgstr "De hele wiki downloaden als Markdown"

#: templates/dg_wiki/home.html:17
msgid ""
"The wiki is empty. Start with a page about what the team knows and others "
"should too."
msgstr ""
"De wiki is leeg. Begin met een pagina over wat het team weet en anderen ook "
"zouden moeten weten."

#: templates/dg_wiki/missing.html:4
msgid "No such page"
msgstr "Pagina bestaat niet"

#: templates/dg_wiki/missing.html:11
#, python-format
msgid ""
"No page has the address <code>%(path)s</code>, and a page above it, <a "
"class=\"wk-missing\" href=\"%(absent_url)s\">%(title)s</a>, is not there "
"either. Start that one first."
msgstr ""
"Geen pagina heeft het adres <code>%(path)s</code>, en een pagina erboven, <a "
"class=\"wk-missing\" href=\"%(absent_url)s\">%(title)s</a>, bestaat ook nog "
"niet. Begin eerst die."

#: templates/dg_wiki/missing.html:13
#, python-format
msgid "No page has the address <code>%(path)s</code>. Start it?"
msgstr "Geen pagina heeft het adres <code>%(path)s</code>. Beginnen?"

#: templates/dg_wiki/missing.html:14
#, python-format
msgid "It goes under <a href=\"%(url)s\">%(title)s</a>."
msgstr "De pagina komt onder <a href=\"%(url)s\">%(title)s</a>."

#: templates/dg_wiki/missing.html:14
msgid "It goes at the top."
msgstr "De pagina komt bovenaan."

#: templates/dg_wiki/missing.html:26
#, python-format
msgid ""
"No page has the address <code>%(path)s</code>, and you may not start one "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Geen pagina heeft het adres <code>%(path)s</code>, en je mag er geen "
"beginnen."

#: templates/dg_wiki/missing.html:28
#, python-format
msgid ""
"No page has the address <code>%(path)s</code>, and none can: no title gives "
"that address."
msgstr ""
"Geen pagina heeft het adres <code>%(path)s</code>, en geen pagina kan het "
"krijgen: geen titel geeft dat adres."

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:15
msgid "More"
msgstr "Meer"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:18
msgid "New page under this one"
msgstr "Nieuwe pagina hieronder"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:19 templates/dg_wiki/page_move.html:19
msgid "Move"
msgstr "Verplaatsen"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:21 templates/dg_wiki/page_translate.html:22
msgid "Translate"
msgstr "Vertalen"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:22
msgid "History"
msgstr "Geschiedenis"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:23
msgid "Download with the pages under it"
msgstr "Downloaden met de pagina's eronder"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:23
msgid "Download as Markdown"
msgstr "Downloaden als Markdown"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:28 templates/dg_wiki/page.html:32
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Verwijderen"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:31
msgid "Delete this page? Its history stays."
msgstr "Deze pagina verwijderen? Haar geschiedenis blijft bewaard."

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:45
msgid "Also in"
msgstr "Ook in:"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:52
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<a href=\"%(url)s\">%(title)s</a>, which this page translates, changed after "
"this page did. It may say more by now."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"%(url)s\">%(title)s</a>, waarvan deze pagina een vertaling is, is "
"later gewijzigd dan deze pagina. Er kan inmiddels meer staan."

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:53
msgid "See what changed"
msgstr "Bekijk wat er veranderde"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:58
#, python-format
msgid "Last changed by %(person)s, %(when)s"
msgstr "Laatst gewijzigd door %(person)s, %(when)s"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:69
msgid "Write an introduction"
msgstr "Schrijf een inleiding"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:71
msgid "This page is empty."
msgstr "Deze pagina is leeg."

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:71
msgid "Write it"
msgstr "Begin met schrijven"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:76
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Op deze pagina"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:85
msgid "Pages under this one"
msgstr "Pagina's hieronder"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:91
msgid "Pages that link here"
msgstr "Pagina's die hierheen linken"

#: templates/dg_wiki/page.html:96
